{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gyre</strong> is a unique space-themed puzzle game! Strategically place planets and enhancements onto dynamic orbits to gain millions of points in combinations.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Orbital Puzzle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place cards to create <strong>combinations out of planets of the same type</strong>! Plan your moves across multiple orbital rings. <strong>Plan ahead</strong> - what works now might not work after the next rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/slide-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80<strong>Strategic Depth with Enhancements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>ENHANCEMENTS</strong> to boost your score:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supernova</strong> connect different planet types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rings</strong> add bonus multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dyson Sphere</strong> boost adjacent planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asteroids</strong> double your combination scores</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/adwa-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude90<strong>Planet Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each planet type has unique abilities that change how the game plays. Some planets control rotations, others clear obstacles or teleport around the board. The key is combining different planet abilities together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/planetPreview1-ezgif.com-effects.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f<strong>OVERScore Phase</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach your goal? The game continues. In OVERScore mode, every move multiplies your future scoring potential. Turn good scores into massive ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/ezgif-7605046b8c4b54.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf20<strong>Gyre</strong> is a puzzle game that challenges you to think in orbits, plan in rotations, and score in millions. Ready to master the gravitational dance of the cosmos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/cancel-ezgif.com-resize__1_.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779580?t=1749296579","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3779580?t=1749296579","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/52b4a4c0414c317f45ff05ed37d4cf71113c9bac/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749296579","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/52b4a4c0414c317f45ff05ed37d4cf71113c9bac/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749296579","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gyre</strong> is a unique space-themed puzzle game! Strategically place planets and enhancements onto dynamic orbits to gain millions of points in combinations.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udf0c Orbital Puzzle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategically place cards to create <strong>combinations out of planets of the same type</strong>! Plan your moves across multiple orbital rings. <strong>Plan ahead</strong> - what works now might not work after the next rotation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/slide-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80<strong>Strategic Depth with Enhancements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use <strong>ENHANCEMENTS</strong> to boost your score:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Supernova</strong> connect different planet types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rings</strong> add bonus multipliers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dyson Sphere</strong> boost adjacent planets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Asteroids</strong> double your combination scores</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/adwa-ezgif.com-resize.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude90<strong>Planet Abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each planet type has unique abilities that change how the game plays. Some planets control rotations, others clear obstacles or teleport around the board. The key is combining different planet abilities together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/planetPreview1-ezgif.com-effects.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf1f<strong>OVERScore Phase</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reach your goal? The game continues. In OVERScore mode, every move multiplies your future scoring potential. Turn good scores into massive ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/ezgif-7605046b8c4b54.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf20<strong>Gyre</strong> is a puzzle game that challenges you to think in orbits, plan in rotations, and score in millions. Ready to master the gravitational dance of the cosmos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/extras/cancel-ezgif.com-resize__1_.gif?t=1749296579\" /></p>","developers":["KwayzeeMF"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779580/e467278b69598ff442a8947c3e047eb22c0ed649/header.jpg?t=1749296579","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257151300,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151300/movie480.mp4?t=1749228090","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151300/movie_max.mp4?t=1749228090"},"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257151300/543e22131ccf539adf902538ab13b76f6bcbdb3b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749228090","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151300/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749228090","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257151300/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749228090"}}],"name":"Gyre","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x86, x64 architecture<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 256 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capable<br></li>